OL,3,GNEWSACouncil given #1m funding to fight
OL,4,Ahomelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has been awarded #1.1m in
OL,7,Fgovernment funding to tackle
OL,8,Fhomelessness and rough sleeping.
OL,10,FDorset Council said the money would
OL,11,Fimprove prevention services, help
OL,12,Fpeople access accommodation sooner and
OL,13,Fprovide new homes for people with a
OL,14,Flong-term history of sleeping rough.
OL,16,FCabinet member for housing and
OL,17,Fhomelessness Gill Taylor said:
OL,18,F"Everyone has a right to a home, and
OL,19,Fnobody should have to sleep rough."
