OL,4,Ahomelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement follows neighbouring
OL,7,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,8,FCouncil receiving #4.7m through the
OL,9,Fgovernment's rough sleeping programme.
